	</div>
</div>


<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Create A Systemd Synapse Unit</h3>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">In <code>/etc/systemd/system/synapse.service</code>:<br></p>


<div class="wp-block-code">
	<div class="cm-editor">
		<div class="cm-scroller">
			
<pre>
<code><div class="cm-line"># /etc/systemd/system/synapse.service</div><div class="cm-line">[Unit]</div><div class="cm-line">Description=Matrix Synapse Server</div><div class="cm-line">After=network.target</div><div class="cm-line">Requires=postgresql.service</div><div class="cm-line"></div><div class="cm-line">[Service]</div><div class="cm-line">Type=forking</div><div class="cm-line">User=synapse</div><div class="cm-line">WorkingDirectory=/var/lib/synapse</div><div class="cm-line">ExecStart=/var/lib/synapse/.venv/bin/synctl start</div><div class="cm-line">ExecStop=/var/lib/synapse/.venv/bin/synctl stop</div><div class="cm-line">PIDFile=/var/lib/synapse/homeserver.pid</div><div class="cm-line">Restart=on-failure</div><div class="cm-line"></div><div class="cm-line">[Install]</div><div class="cm-line">WantedBy=multi-user.target</div><div class="cm-line"></div><div class="cm-line"></div><div class="cm-line">Reload systemd &amp; enable, start Synapse:</div><div class="cm-line"></div><div class="cm-line"></div><div class="cm-line">sudo systemctl daemon-reload</div><div class="cm-line">sudo systemctl enable synapse</div><div class="cm-line">sudo systemctl start synapse</div><div class="cm-line">sudo systemctl status synapse</div><div class="cm-line"></div><div class="cm-line"></div><div class="cm-line"></div><div class="cm-line"></div><div class="cm-line"></div><div class="cm-line"></div></code></pre>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>


<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Example Homeserver Configuration</h3>



